&lt;br/&gt;
Oh well, you can only do so much, right? 😒&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
But 76 of us rode around for an hour down some alleys, through the fan and such. Trying to hang close to home base incase we had to bail. &lt;br/&gt;
