quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/0efda9c2925bf3a5.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;We’re heading into the colder, darker rides of the year, so the numbers of riders will be expected to go down....&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/8b031e4d7aae4913.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;We’re heading into the colder, darker rides of the year, so the numbers of riders will be expected to go down....&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/3d04a9cfdd7c2f57.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We’re heading into the colder, darker rides of the year, so the numbers of riders will be expected to go down.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Which is fine…it’s… it’s fine. 😏&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
But we had a good group of about 55 riders to brave the darkness and ride around from Byrd Park to @willow_lawn and back. Hitting some alleys along the way. &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
We also had to scramble to accommodate an ambulance… twice! It apparently had to make a u-turn and come back at us! 🚨🤦🏾&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Some of us made it over to @stellasgrocery in @scottsaddition for a chill out session in the cold before we all went our separate ways. And the “soul survivor.” was… well, take a look and see. 😏🖐🏾&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Ok, you all have a great week, be safe, GO VOTE 🗳️ &lt;br/&gt;
and we’ll see you Monday! 😄🚲👍🏾#bikemondaybros</content></entry>
